-- CLASSIFICATION = WordPress taxonomies (NOT custom tables).
-- Registered against post_type 'fevent_event'; terms live in
-- wp_terms/wp_term_taxonomy, links in wp_term_relationships,
-- extra fields in wp_termmeta. One term reused across many events.
--   fevent_event_type  (hierarchical) — category/type of event
--       term meta: fevent_color, fevent_icon_id
