--   fevent_organizer  (hierarchical) — who runs it (reusable across events)
--       term meta: fevent_email, fevent_phone, fevent_website, fevent_social, fevent_logo_id
--   fevent_performer  (flat) — speaker/artist (thin: name + photo, no profile page)
--       term meta: fevent_photo_id, fevent_designation, fevent_social
